cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas este software, cítalo con los metadatos de este archivo."
type: software
title: "ColoQ (CRC-digital-twin): mechanistic digital twin for colorectal cancer molecular subtyping (CMS1–4) via Hopfield attractor dynamics on an RT-qPCR panel"
abstract: >-
  Mechanistic digital twin of colorectal cancer that models the four
  Consensus Molecular Subtypes (CMS1–CMS4) as attractors of a continuous
  Hopfield-type network, calibrated against real cohorts and designed to run
  on a 10-gene RT-qPCR-only panel. Research tool only; not a medical device.
authors:
